      "issues": [
        "- In the linguistic contrast table, the row for oxidation/reduction reads “ऑक्सीकरण (उपचयन) / अपचयन” which incorrectly attaches “उपचयन” (reduction) to “ऑक्सीकरण” (oxidation) → should be “ऑक्सीकरण / अपचयन” to correctly pair oxidation with oxidation and reduction with reduction."
